Subject: [PATCH] local 0107: qwen36 prompt cache: states wait in GPU memory
 instead of being dropped, keep_rank eviction

---
 .../families/qwen3_5_moe/cuda/disk_points.py  | 29 +++++++++--
 .../families/qwen3_5_moe/cuda/multi.py        | 48 ++++++++++++-------
 tests/test_qwen36_prompt_store.py             | 47 ++++++++++++++++++
